[TITLE]
SIM-03: a 10 kW constant-power pump lifts 10 L/s from reservoir R1 (head 0) to J1
Correct head gain: P / (rho g Q) = 10 / (9.81 x 0.010) = 101.9 m

[JUNCTIONS]
;ID   Elev  Demand
 J1   0     10        ; L/s

[RESERVOIRS]
;ID   Head
 R1   0

[PUMPS]
;ID   N1  N2  Parameters
 PU1  R1  J1  POWER 10    ; kW, because the units are SI

[TIMES]
 Duration  0

[OPTIONS]
 Units     LPS
 Headloss  H-W

[END]
